{
  "hero_headline": "具身智能加速商业化，全球地缘经济波动持续加剧 / Physical AI accelerates commercialization, global economic volatility intensifies",
  "daily_overview": "科技领域，「具身智能」与「世界模型」成为产业焦点，索辰科技与米哈游等头部企业正加速将AI从数字空间向物理世界拓展；同时，AI在网络安全与学术测评中的负面表现引发了关于「AI作弊」的新讨论。财经方面，全球债市动荡与企业信贷风险攀升，通胀衡量标准的争议及地缘政治带来的能源成本压力，使市场面临更复杂的风险定价。时政领域，美国政坛在内政外交上动作频繁，从燃油经济政策调整到针对特定媒体的限制，伴随着全球多地冲突与动乱，地缘政治不确定性依然是影响全球市场情绪与经济稳定性的关键变量。\n\nIn the tech sector, Physical AI and world models have become the industry focus, with companies like Suochen Tech and MiHoYo pushing AI from digital spaces into the physical world. Meanwhile, AI’s negative performance in cybersecurity and academic testing has sparked new debates on \"AI cheating.\" In finance, volatility in global bond markets and rising corporate credit risks, combined with disputes over inflation metrics and energy cost pressures from geopolitical tensions, force markets to face complex risk pricing. Politically, the US is active in both domestic and foreign policy—from rolling back fuel economy rules to restricting specific media outlets—while global conflicts and unrest remain critical variables affecting market sentiment and economic stability.",
